<title>USA: TABLE - Astoria Financial Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Astoria Financial Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE SUCCESS, N.Y. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			   $0.72		    $0.56</p>
<p> Net			  15,207		   11,710</p>
<p> Net int income	   49,445		   46,824</p>
<p> Loan loss prov	    1,414		    2,042</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   21,042		   21,097</p>
<p>	  SIX MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			   $1.45		    $1.24</p>
<p> Net			  30,641		   26,428</p>
<p> Net int income	   98,901		   91,558</p>
<p> Loan loss prov	    1,914		    2,564</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   21,178		   21,348</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Shr amounts are primary.</p>
<p>Fully diluted shr is $0.72 vs $0.55 for Q2 and $1.44 vs $1.23 for six months.</p>
<p>Total assets at current period end were $7.66 bln.</p>
